6ab-db0e-11ef-b779-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊山","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆山","start_index":679,"tongjian_id":"9030a6ac-db0e-11ef-ae0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豫州","place_name_jianti_auto":"豫州","start_index":687,"tongjian_id":"9030a6ad-db0e-11ef-a4df-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"益州","place_name_jianti_auto":"益州","start_index":714,"tongjian_id":"9030a6ae-db0e-11ef-9684-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","start_index":743,"tongjian_id":"9030a6af-db0e-11ef-82d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"續漢志：秦有監郡御史，監諸郡；漢興省之，但遣丞相史分刺諸州，無常官。孝武帝初置刺史十三人，秩六百石。古今註曰：常以春分行部，郡、國各遣一吏迎界上。漢舊儀曰：詔書舊典，刺史班宣，周行郡國，省察治政，黜陟能否，斷理冤獄，以六條問事，非條所問，卽不省。一條，強宗豪右田宅踰制，以強陵弱，以衆暴寡。二條，二千石不奉詔書、遵承典制，倍公向私，旁詔牟利，侵漁百姓，聚歛爲姦。三條，二千石不卹疑獄，風厲殺人，怒則任刑，喜則任賞，煩擾苛暴，剝戮黎元，爲百姓所疾；山崩石裂，妖祥訛言。四條，二千石選置不平，苟阿所愛，蔽賢寵頑。五條，二千石子弟怙恃榮勢，請託所監。六條，二千石違公下比，阿附豪強，通行貨賂，割損政令。續漢志又曰：諸州常以八月巡行郡國，錄囚徒，考殿最。初，歲盡詣京都奏事，中興，但因計吏。與古今註異。據晉志，帝改禹貢雍州曰涼州，梁州曰益州，又置徐州，復禹貢舊號，北置朔方，南置交趾，與荊、揚、兗、豫、青、冀、幽、幷爲十三州。春秋元命包及晉書·地理志，昴、畢散爲冀州。其地有險有易，帝王所都，亂則冀安，弱則冀強，荒則冀豐。箕星散爲幽州，言北方太陰，故以幽冥爲號。營室流爲幷州，不以衞水爲號，又不以恆山爲稱，而云幷者，蓋以其在兩谷之間也。五星流爲兗州。端也，信也；又云，蓋取沇水以名焉。天氐流爲徐州，蓋取舒緩之義；或云因徐丘以立名。虛、危流爲青州；周禮曰：正東曰青州，蓋取地居少陽，其色青，故名。牽牛流爲揚州，以爲江南之氣躁勁，厥性輕揚；亦云州界多水，水波輕揚也。軫星散爲荊州，強也，言其氣躁強；亦曰警也，言南蠻數爲寇逆，其人有道後服，無道先強，常警備也；又云，取名於荊山。鉤鈐星別爲豫州；豫者，舒也，言稟中和之氣，性理安舒也。參、伐流爲益州；益之言阨，言其所在之地險阨；亦曰疆壤益大，故以名焉。涼州，以地處西方，常寒涼也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"续汉志：秦有监郡御史，监诸郡；汉兴省之，但遣丞相史分刺诸州，无常官。孝武帝初置刺史十三人，秩六百石。古今注曰：常以春分行部，郡、国各遣一吏迎界上。汉旧仪曰：诏书旧典，刺史班宣，周行郡国，省察治政，黜陟能否，断理冤狱，以六条问事，非条所问，即不省。一条，强宗豪右田宅逾制，以强陵弱，以众暴寡。二条，二千石不奉诏书、遵承典制，倍公向私，旁诏牟利，侵渔百姓，聚歛为奸。三条，二千石不恤疑狱，风厉杀人，怒则任刑，喜则任赏，烦扰苛暴，剥戮黎元，为百姓所疾；山崩石裂，妖祥讹言。四条，二千石选置不平，苟阿所爱，蔽贤宠顽。五条，二千石子弟怙恃荣势，请托所监。六条，二千石违公下比，阿附豪强，通行货赂，割损政令。续汉志又曰：诸州常以八月巡行郡国，录囚徒，考殿最。初，岁尽诣京都奏事，中兴，但因计吏。与古今注异。据晋志，帝改禹贡雍州曰凉州，梁州曰益州，又置徐州，复禹贡旧号，北置朔方，南置交趾，与荆、扬、兖、豫、青、冀、幽、幷为十三州。春秋元命包及晋书·地理志，昴、毕散为冀州。其地有险有易，帝王所都，乱则冀安，弱则冀强，荒则冀丰。箕星散为幽州，言北方太阴，故以幽冥为号。营室流为幷州，不以衞水为号，又不以恒山为称，而云幷者，盖以其在两谷之间也。五星流为兖州。端也，信也；又云，盖取沇水以名焉。天氐流为徐州，盖取舒缓之义；或云因徐丘以立名。虚、危流为青州；周礼曰：正东曰青州，盖取地居少阳，其色青，故名。牵牛流为扬州，以为江南之气躁劲，厥性轻扬；亦云州界多水，水波轻扬也。轸星散为荆州，强也，言其气躁强；亦曰警也，言南蛮数为寇逆，其人有道后服，无道先强，常警备也；又云，取名于荆山。钩钤星别为豫州；豫者，舒也，言禀中和之气，性理安舒也。参、伐流为益州；益之言阨，言其所在之地险阨；亦曰疆壤益大，故以名焉。凉州，以地处西方，常寒凉也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"9030a685-db0e-11ef-8d01-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"刺史","official_note":"刺史是漢代監察地方州郡的官職，負責監督地方官員，防止腐敗和濫權。在《資治通鑑》此段中，漢武帝設置十三個州部，並在每個州部任命刺史，以加強中央對新開拓疆域的控制和管理，這反映了漢朝擴張後的地方行政改革。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"皆置刺史焉","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"5d8bf390-5195-4bd5-b410-56956481f0a0"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"胡","resolved_place_entity_id":78,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9030a6bb-db0e-11ef-9b5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"越","place_name_jianti_auto":"越","resolved_place_entity_id":357,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9030a6bc-db0e-11ef-9cc6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"交趾","place_name_jianti_auto":"交趾","place_note":"两广、海南及越南北部","resolved_place_entity_id":579,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9030a6bd-db0e-11ef-b0a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔方","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔方","place_note":"河套地区","resolved_place_entity_id":206,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9030a6be-db0e-11ef-984d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀","place_note":"河北中、南部","resolved_place_entity_id":216,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9030a6bf-db0e-11ef-a3d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幽","place_name_jianti_auto":"幽","place_note":"河北北及辽宁","resolved_place_entity_id":102,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c0-db0e-11ef-af7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷","resolved_place_entity_id":186,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c1-db0e-11ef-9ca6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兗","place_name_jianti_auto":"兖","place_note":"山东西部","resolved_place_entity_id":211,"start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c2-db0e-11ef-9418-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐","place_note":"江苏北部","resolved_place_entity_id":191,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c3-db0e-11ef-bc1b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"青","place_name_jianti_auto":"青","place_note":"山東东部","resolved_place_entity_id":242,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c4-db0e-11ef-a8ba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"揚","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬","place_note":"安徽中部及江南地区","resolved_place_entity_id":419,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c5-db0e-11ef-b5d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","place_note":"湖北、湖南","resolved_place_entity_id":103,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c6-db0e-11ef-ac30-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豫","place_name_jianti_auto":"豫","place_note":"河南","resolved_place_entity_id":185,"start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c7-db0e-11ef-9e05-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"益","place_name_jianti_auto":"益","place_note":"四川、云南","resolved_place_entity_id":204,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c8-db0e-11ef-89ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉","place_note":"甘肅","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"9030a6c9-db0e-11ef-99f3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷一百）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉因之[汉刺史无常治。王范《交广春秋》：汉初，交州治羸...","context_before":"...越也。今人多以两广为粤，闽浙为越矣]。秦末，赵陀王其地。","source_end_index":321,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ad9e4357-0094-5a58-a945-de8298f56271","source_start_index":304,"source_text":"汉元鼎六年，讨平之，寻置交趾刺史。"}],"path":"广东方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷一百）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3上旣攘卻胡、越，開地斥境，乃置交趾、朔方之州，及冀、幽、幷、兗、徐、青、揚、荊、豫、益、涼等州，凡十三部，皆置刺史焉。","content_fanyi":"汉武帝驱逐了北方的匈奴，消灭了南方的越人政权，开辟并扩大了疆土，于是设置交趾、朔方二州，以及冀州、幽州、并州、兖州、徐州、青州、扬州、荆州、豫州、益州、凉州等州，总共十三个州部，每部都设置刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"3上既攘却胡、越，开地斥境，乃置交趾、朔方之州，及冀、幽、幷、兖、徐、青、扬、荆、豫、益、凉等州，凡十三部，皆置刺史焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1708,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9030a684-db0e-11ef-a00b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9030a6cc-db0e-11ef-b5fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：奔，走也。踶，蹈也。奔踶者，乘之則奔，立則踶人也。踶，徒計翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：奔，走也。踶，蹈也。奔踶者，乘之则奔，立则踶人也。踶，徒计翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"9030a6cb-db0e-11ef-b139-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9030a6ce-db0e-11ef-9dc3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉灼曰：負俗，謂被世譏論也。累，力瑞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋灼曰：负俗，谓被世讥论也。累，力瑞翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"9030a6cd-db0e-11ef-99fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d0-db0e-11ef-aa63-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：泛，覆也；與覂同。言馬有逸氣者多能覆車。泛，方勇翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：泛，覆也；与覂同。言马有逸气者多能覆车。泛，方勇翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"9030a6cf-db0e-11ef-b82c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d2-db0e-11ef-a0a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d3-db0e-11ef-b12a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如淳曰：士行有卓異不入俗，弛而見斥逐者。師古曰：跅者，跅落無檢局也；弛者，放廢不遵法度也。跅，音拓。弛，式爾翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如淳曰：士行有卓异不入俗，弛而见斥逐者。师古曰：跅者，跅落无检局也；弛者，放废不遵法度也。跅，音拓。弛，式尔翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d1-db0e-11ef-89f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d5-db0e-11ef-80cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"光武","people_name_jianti_auto":"光武","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d6-db0e-11ef-86cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d7-db0e-11ef-8f1b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"應劭曰：舊言秀才，避光武諱稱茂才。異等者，超等軼羣，不與凡同也。師古曰：茂，美也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"应劭曰：旧言秀才，避光武讳称茂才。异等者，超等轶群，不与凡同也。师古曰：茂，美也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"9030a6d4-db0e-11ef-9368-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"將","official_note":"將指將軍或將領，負責軍事指揮，在漢代常為高級武官，此處用於選拔人才擔任將職。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"可爲將、相及使絕國者","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"b6a7068f-4fe7-4ab1-8254-77952e4b506e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"相","official_note":"相指丞相或宰相，為中央政府最高行政長官，此處用於選拔人才擔任相職。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"可爲將、相及使絕國者","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"c4c2ba35-df69-4101-af25-de7b7ee9950a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9030a6ca-db0e-11ef-8744-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dì","source_anchor_text":"故馬或奔踶而致千里","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":34,"text":"踶","tongjian_id":"aefabcf8-f8e3-57db-8907-3f15a4a36007"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9030a6ca-db0e-11ef-8744-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"tuò","source_anchor_text":"泛駕之馬跅弛之士亦","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":58,"text":"跅","tongjian_id":"eb7e9166-d74b-5c4e-92ce-c7c78a988f1f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"4上以名臣文武欲盡，乃下詔曰：「蓋有非常之功，必待非常之人。故馬或奔踶而致千里，士或有負俗之累而立功名。夫泛駕之馬，跅弛之士，亦在御之而已。其令州、郡察吏、民有茂才、異等可爲將、相及使絕國者。」","content_fanyi":"汉武帝因为朝中有名的文武大臣快要没有了，于是下诏访求贤才说：“大凡非同寻常的功业，一定要等待非同寻常的人才能完成。所以有的马虽然凶暴不驯，却能奔驰千里；有的士人虽然受到世俗的牵累，却能建立功名。至于那些容易翻车的马、放荡不羁的士人，也只在于如何驾驭他们罢了。现在命令各州、郡长官考察下属官吏和百姓中具有优秀才干或不同凡俗、能够担任将、相以及出使绝远国家的人，举荐给朝廷。”","content_jianti_auto":"4上以名臣文武欲尽，乃下诏曰：「盖有非常之功，必待非常之人。故马或奔踶而致千里，士或有负俗之累而立功名。夫泛驾之马，跅弛之士，亦在御之而已。其令州、郡察吏、民有茂才、异等可为将、相及使绝国者。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1709,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9030a6ca-db0e-11ef-8744-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000548"}],"reign_name":"五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"五年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"902e837f-db0e-11ef-93d5-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙亥、前一○六）","year_int":-106},"message":"success","success":true}